{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Affine Combination","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>仿射组合（Affine Combination）</h1>\n<p>仿射组合（affine combination）是系数之和为一的线性组合：<span class=\"math inline\">y=\\sum_i\\theta_i x_i</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">\\sum_i\\theta_i=1</span>；系数可为负数。</p>\n<p><strong>直线（line）</strong>：形如 <span class=\"math inline\">y=\\theta x_1 + (1-\\theta)x_2， \\theta \\in R</span> 的点构成的集合称为过 <span class=\"math inline\">x_1, x_2</span> 的直线。</p>\n<p>这与任意系数的<a href=\"#/learn/la.linear-combination?anchor=definition\">线性组合（linear combination）</a>不同；限制系数非负，就得到<a href=\"#/learn/opt.convex-combination?anchor=definition\">凸组合（convex combination）</a>。</p>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">教材相应章节 / Reference</a>。</p>\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-boyd-convex-optimization\"><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">Convex Optimization</a> — Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe · 2004 · Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"opt.affine-combination.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.affine-combination","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"仿射组合"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Affine Combination","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>仿射组合（Affine Combination）</h1>\n<p>仿射组合（affin